1
00:00:09,898 --> 00:00:17,700
This is the work in hand. Every job the
company is carrying, in the state it is in.

2
00:00:18,155 --> 00:00:24,589
A new one starts with a sentence. Write
what somebody standing there would need to

3
00:00:24,589 --> 00:00:24,982
know.

4
00:00:25,435 --> 00:00:30,776
How urgent it is, in the words your
own team already uses about work.

5
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:36,989
When it has to be done by. Pick a day, and
add an hour if somebody is expecting you.

6
00:00:37,441 --> 00:00:43,346
And which part of the business it belongs
to. That decides who sees it and what it

7
00:00:43,346 --> 00:00:43,850
can do.

8
00:00:44,306 --> 00:00:48,393
Raise it, and it is on the
board where everyone works from.

9
00:00:48,845 --> 00:00:55,479
Open it and it is waiting: a
description, room for photographs, and nobody on it

10
00:00:55,479 --> 00:00:55,811
yet.

11
00:00:56,262 --> 00:01:01,649
Which is the next video: giving it to
somebody, and what happens the moment you do.

